+- id: test-slow-suite-serialization
+  subsystem: ci
+  lifecycle: active
+  files: ["test/**", scripts/test-tier-manifest.mjs, .github/workflows/ci.yml]
+  fact: >-
+    Run only ONE full test suite at a time: never background or parallelize `node --test` runs,
+    because the deny floor refuses concurrent full-suite work. A single test file or
+    `--test-name-pattern` run is allowed, and `rmd preflight --coverage` already runs its coverage
+    shards sequentially. The test-slow gate runs the manifest's slow-tier files in two shards, so
+    do not start a competing full suite while diagnosing or repairing a red slow shard.
+  evidence: >-
+    Seven pull requests recorded as ci-learning:9362:test-slow were repaired after test-slow
+    refused them. The slow tier is selected from scripts/test-tier-manifest.json and runs in the
+    test-slow-shard workflow; the repository deny floor rejects overlapping full node test runs.
+  src: "ci-learning:9362:test-slow"
+  cited: "2026-10-08"
